<title>FRANCE: Havas maintains profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Havas maintains profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas chairman Pierre Dauzier on Friday reiterated the company's forecast of a 1997 net attributable profit of 1.5 billion francs, after taking account of a payment by Bertelsmann for obtaining 50 percent in CLT.</p>
<p>Nicolas Duhamel, finance director, said this payment to Havas would be 600 million francs, after tax.</p>
<p>The men were speaking at Havas' shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
